<!-- ===== RESIDENCY ROUTE ===== -->
<section class="imm4-section imm4-section--bg" id="lo-trinh" aria-labelledby="imm4-route-title" style="--imm4-route-bg:url('https://immgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Konia-Green-lo-trinh.webp')">
<div class="imm4-shell">
<blockquote class="imm4-route-quote imm4-reveal"><p>Owning a property at <strong>Konia Green</strong> can open the way to permanent residence in Cyprus for you and your family, once you meet the program conditions.</p></blockquote>
<h2 class="imm4-title" id="imm4-route-title">Your route to<br> <em>permanent residence in Cyprus</em></h2>
<div class="imm4-route"><div class="imm4-route__col">
<div class="imm4-route__steps imm4-reveal">
<article class="imm4-route__step"><h3>A qualifying real estate purchase</h3><p>A qualifying property starts at €300,000 plus VAT and must be bought new from the developer.</p></article>
<article class="imm4-route__step"><h3>Prepare the file</h3><p>The application can include you, your spouse, and your dependent children. Besides owning the property, you need to show a secured annual income.</p></article>
<article class="imm4-route__step"><h3>Become a permanent resident</h3><p>You need to visit Cyprus once every 2 years to keep the status.</p></article>
</div>
<blockquote class="imm4-clarity imm4-reveal"><p>The information on this website is for general reference and may not reflect the latest program requirements or legal rules.</p></blockquote>
</div></div>
</div>
</section>

