<!-- ===== RESIDENCY BENEFITS ===== -->
<section class="imm4-section" id="loi-the" aria-labelledby="imm4-benefits-title">
<div class="imm4-shell">
<h2 class="imm4-title" id="imm4-benefits-title">Advantages of<br> <em>Cyprus permanent residence</em></h2>
<p class="imm4-rights__intro">Owning a property at Konia Green can lead to permanent residence in Cyprus for you and your family, with the following benefits:</p>
<div class="imm4-rights imm4-reveal">
<article class="imm4-right">
<div class="imm4-right__icons" aria-hidden="true"><span>verified_user</span></div>
<div class="imm4-right__num">01</div>
<h3>Living in Cyprus</h3>
<ul><li>You can live, study, and run a business in Cyprus.</li><li>A high quality of life, with well-developed infrastructure.</li></ul>
</article>
<article class="imm4-right">
<div class="imm4-right__icons" aria-hidden="true"><span>verified_user</span></div>
<div class="imm4-right__num">02</div>
<h3>Healthcare and education</h3>
<ul><li>A modern healthcare system to European standards, free of charge for citizens and permanent residents.</li><li>A quality education system on the British model, recognized worldwide, at a reasonable cost (lower than comparable international schools in many home countries).</li></ul>
</article>
<article class="imm4-right imm4-right--legal">
<div class="imm4-right__icons" aria-hidden="true"><span>verified_user</span></div>
<div class="imm4-right__num">03</div>
<h3>Business environment and tax</h3>
<ul><li>An open, transparent business environment with a clear regulatory system.</li><li>Cyprus has one of the lowest corporate tax rates in Europe, at 12.5%.</li><li>Favorable tax policy: no tax on worldwide income and no inheritance tax.</li></ul>
</article>
</div>
<div class="imm4-citizen-route imm4-reveal">
<h3 class="imm4-citizen-route__title">The route to Cypriot citizenship</h3>
<ol class="imm4-citizen-steps">
<li class="imm4-citizen-step"><span class="imm4-citizen-step__num" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Hold permanent residence (PR)</h4><p>The physical permanent residence card is renewed every 5 years, provided you still own the property.</p></li>
<li class="imm4-citizen-step"><span class="imm4-citizen-step__num" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Meet the residence and language conditions</h4><p>At least 8 years of physical residence within an 11-year period, Greek language at CEFR level B1, and a pass in the cultural integration test.</p></li>
<li class="imm4-citizen-step"><span class="imm4-citizen-step__num" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Cypriot (EU) citizenship</h4><p>Dual citizenship is allowed. A Cypriot passport gives visa-free travel to more than 170 destinations.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</section>


<!-- ===== CONSULTATION CTA ===== -->
<section class="imm4-section imm4-consult" aria-labelledby="imm4-consult-title">
<div class="imm4-shell">
<div class="imm4-consult__head">
